    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-11" id="fn-11" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Page 216 does not include common plant construction work in progress shown on page 356.&#160; Page 356 represents allocation of common plant construction work in progress which is recorded at UGI Gas Division.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-12" id="fn-12" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">This amount represents depreciation expense allocated to the Electric Utility from the Gas Utility related to Common Assets. The amount needs to be deducted from the Electric Utility&#8217;s accumulated depreciation roll forward because the assets are recorded on the Gas Utility&#8217;s asset records.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-13" id="fn-13" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">This amount represent a adjustment to depreciation expense related to the over dereciation if the&#160; Power Supply asset</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-14" id="fn-14" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">These numbers represent Renewal Energy Credits (The Company does not hold any inventory of SO2 or NOx allowances).</link:footnote>
