    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-53" id="fn-53" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">UGI Utillities, Inc. does not file anything related to the Statistical Classifications in (b) directly with FERC, as the filing is handled by PJM as part of their Member's Benefit Appeal.</link:footnote>
