    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-63" id="fn-63" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">UGI is a 1% owner of this transmission line. The line is not within the UGI service territory.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-64" id="fn-64" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">UGI's portion of the line only, length of line that is within UGI's service territory.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-65" id="fn-65" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Corporate administrative services are allocated to UGI Utilities and other business units of UGI Corporation based primarily on an Modified Wisconsin Formula (&#8220;MWF&#8221;).&#160; This formula measures the relative size of the business units which receive the services.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-66" id="fn-66" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Labor and Benefits costs are allocated by UGI Corporation to UGI Utilities based on the time spent by UGI Corporation employees directly on UGI Utilities matters.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-67" id="fn-67" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">IT costs are allocated by UGI Energy Services to UGI Utilities based on their portion of the total number of licensed users for the relevant software.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-68" id="fn-68" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">401k savings plan costs are charged to affiliates based on the actual costs for contributions on behalf of the employees who are employed by the affiliates.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-69" id="fn-69" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">401k savings plan costs are charged to affiliates based on the actual costs for contributions on behalf of the employees who are employed by the affiliates.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-70" id="fn-70" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">401k savings plan costs are charged to affiliates based on the actual costs for contributions on behalf of the employees who are employed by the affiliates.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-71" id="fn-71" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">401k savings plan costs are charged to affiliates based on the actual costs for contributions on behalf of the employees who are employed by the affiliates.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-72" id="fn-72" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Employee benefit insurance (medical, dental, etc.) costs are charged to affiliates based on the actual costs for the claims of the employees who are employed by the affiliates.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-73" id="fn-73" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Employee benefit insurance (medical, dental, etc.) costs are charged to affiliates based on the actual costs for the claims of the employees who are employed by the affiliates.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-74" id="fn-74" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Employee benefit insurance (medical, dental, etc.) costs are charged to affiliates based on the actual costs for the claims of the employees who are employed by the affiliates.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-75" id="fn-75" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Labor and benefits costs are charged to affiliates based on an estimate of the time that Utilities employees devote to providing services to these affiliates.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-76" id="fn-76" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Labor and benefits costs are charged to affiliates based on an estimate of the time that Utilities employees devote to providing services to these affiliates.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-77" id="fn-77" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Labor and benefits costs are charged to affiliates based on an estimate of the time that Utilities employees devote to providing services to these affiliates.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-78" id="fn-78" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">IT costs are allocated to UGI Energy Services based on their portion of the total number of licensed users for the relevant software.</link:footnote>
